-- Rewrite repeated visit conclusions as independent recent review facts for each merchant.
UPDATE reviews SET body='When I arrived at 12:30 p.m. during lunch, half of the twenty seats were already occupied. Two mats by the wall had cracked, and the administrator had marked them out of service; the free activity had no sales pitch.' WHERE rowid=1;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The shop assistant helped me compare the heights of two wrist rests and let me try placing my own keyboard on them. The price tag matched the amount charged, and unopened accessories can be returned within seven days.' WHERE rowid=2;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The reading room was very quiet in the afternoon, with four outlets by the windows and a restroom on the same floor. The family area is somewhat louder on weekends, so those seeking focused reading can sit on the north side.' WHERE rowid=3;
UPDATE reviews SET body='After making an appointment, I waited about ten minutes. The staff first explained the consultation content and charges, then let me decide whether to continue. They did not promise that long-term discomfort could be resolved in a single session.' WHERE rowid=4;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The room accommodates only two customers, and the rollers and soft mats were cleaned fairly promptly. The service staff ask about pressure; the short experience was acceptable, but the package prices were high.' WHERE rowid=5;
UPDATE reviews SET body='There were plenty of vacant seats on weekday mornings, and the tables had enough room for a fifteen-inch laptop, with outlets beneath the seats. Coffee prices were average, and there was no training equipment in the shop.' WHERE rowid=6;
UPDATE reviews SET body='Temporary workstations are charged by the hour, and the network speed test was stable. The phone booth requires registration at the front desk. After 7 p.m., the air-conditioning temperature was somewhat low.' WHERE rowid=7;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The equipment consisted only of a horizontal bar, a leg-stretching rack, and an open area. There were many older people and children in the evening. The ground becomes wet after rain, and the cleaning staff put up a prominent warning sign.' WHERE rowid=8;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The mechanical keyboard I submitted for repair had its switches replaced by the next day, and the old parts were bagged and returned. The quotation listed labor and materials separately, making the process transparent.' WHERE rowid=9;
UPDATE reviews SET body='There were plenty of changing lockers in the facility. After the group class ended on Wednesday evening, the queue for the shower area was about fifteen minutes long. The open activity area had good ventilation.' WHERE rowid=10;
UPDATE reviews SET body='Residents were already out for a walk when I passed by at 7 a.m. The facilities were in good condition, and the bus stop was right next to them. There was no staff member on site to provide guidance, so it is suitable for doing simple activities independently.' WHERE rowid=11;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The shop lets you test keys and connection cables on site, and they explain their fault assessment before starting repairs. My keyboard only had a loose port, so I was charged the basic inspection fee.' WHERE rowid=12;
UPDATE reviews SET body='It is convenient to come here for exercise on rainy days, and there was no standing water on the rubber flooring. Two rowing machines were being serviced at the time, and the front desk clearly posted the date they would be back in service.' WHERE rowid=13;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The community activity room is used by the choir in the morning and only opens to individuals during the lunch break. The tables and chairs can be moved, and the hours posted on the wall matched the actual schedule.' WHERE rowid=14;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The monitor stand I bought was in intact packaging, and the clerk reminded me to measure the thickness of the desktop first. I received a paper receipt after payment, and no additional installation service was included.' WHERE rowid=15;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The first floor of the library is under renovation, so book checkouts and returns have been moved to a temporary counter on the second floor. The study area is still open, but you can hear drilling on the side facing the construction.' WHERE rowid=16;
UPDATE reviews SET body='After making an appointment by phone, I barely had to wait. The receptionist first asked about my daily activities and previous conditions. Follow-up services can be purchased individually, and signing up for a membership is not required.' WHERE rowid=17;
UPDATE reviews SET body='I tried the twenty-minute gentle relaxation session, and the intensity could be adjusted at any time. The room was clean, but the front desk kept promoting membership packages, which affected the overall experience.' WHERE rowid=18;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The seats toward the back are fairly quiet, and there were still empty tables at 3 p.m. The steps at the entrance are low, but there were two fewer power outlets than in the photos on the page.' WHERE rowid=19;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The meeting room has mediocre soundproofing, but the network at the communal workstations is stable. The cancellation option for reservations is clearly marked, and canceling an hour in advance did not incur a fee.' WHERE rowid=20;
UPDATE reviews SET body='It is about an eight-minute walk from the subway station. The room is smaller than it appears in the photos and can accommodate no more than three people at a time. The staff first demonstrated the movements, then let customers decide the duration for themselves.' WHERE rowid=21;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The shop was fairly empty on Sunday afternoon, and the row of seats against the wall was suitable for reading. The music was not loud, but there were not many dessert options.' WHERE rowid=22;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The shared area has both height-adjustable desks and regular long tables, but there are only six height-adjustable desks. The visitor network connected without any issues, and printing is charged separately.' WHERE rowid=23;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The basketball court was lively in the evening, but there was still space nearby for simple stretching. The lights came on promptly at 7 p.m., but the water dispenser was out of service that day.' WHERE rowid=24;
UPDATE reviews SET body='I booked the low-intensity session, and the staff did not increase the range of the movements. The single-session price was posted on the board at the front desk, and before I left they only asked whether I wanted to book another appointment.' WHERE rowid=25;
UPDATE reviews SET body='There was traffic noise on the side of the coffee shop facing the street, while the second floor was much quieter. I sat there for an hour on Tuesday morning, and the clerk did not pressure me to order another drink.' WHERE rowid=26;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The activity room reopened after equipment maintenance, and three exercise mats and one foam roller had been replaced with new ones. The number of people noticeably decreased after 12:40 p.m.' WHERE rowid=27;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The in-store stock mainly consists of keycaps and connection cables, while the split keyboard is only a display model. The price labels are clear, and the clerks will not place online shop orders on a customer''s behalf.' WHERE rowid=28;
UPDATE reviews SET body='The children''s reading area and adults'' area are separated by a glass door, and the noise level on Saturday was still acceptable. The librarian promptly replenished the paper cups for the water dispenser.' WHERE rowid=29;
UPDATE reviews SET body='On my first visit, I had a 15-minute consultation about my situation, and each charge was clearly itemized. The recommendations were very conservative, with no promotional claims such as "quick correction."' WHERE rowid=30;
UPDATE reviews SET body='I arrived at the activity room at 1 p.m.; the notice at the entrance said there would be a community meeting at 2 p.m. The administrator allowed personal use until 1:50 p.m. and reminded me in advance to put away the equipment.' WHERE rowid=40;
UPDATE reviews SET body='There were only 6 people at the early session on Sunday, and there were enough mats. The windows could be opened for ventilation, but you need to bring your own small lock for the locker.' WHERE rowid=43;
